# Never push to main

This repository’s default branch is `main`. Do not push to it.

- Never run `git push` with destination `main` or `master` (including `origin/main`, `HEAD:main`, or a current branch named `main`).
- Never fast-forward, force-push, or merge-push into `main` or `master`.
- Push work to `app` or another non-main branch only.
- If asked to push to `main` or `master`, refuse and use `app` (or another named working branch) instead.
